{"team":"CHI","col":"#F1873B","identity":"run-heavy","funnel":"run-funnel","plays_pg":64.3,"adot":8.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>Bleed the Clock</h2><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>19%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>Their run game attacks the perimeter \u2014 <strong>31% of carries hit the edge</strong> (league ~25%), an outside-zone lean that rewards speed backs and can boom for chunk gains.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (61% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 58% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>They play fast \u2014 <strong>64 snaps a game</strong> (league ~61), and the extra volume is a rising tide that lifts everyone's counting stats.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>run-first</strong> (52% pass), funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>D'Andre Swift</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 Soft on the Ground</h2><p>They surrender <strong>134 rushing</strong> and <strong>239 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). The run moves against them \u2014 <strong>target opposing RB1s</strong>.</p><p>They give up deep shots (21% of throws travel 15+ vs ~19%) \u2014 big-play WR upside against them.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.56/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>WR1 receiving TDs</strong> (0.47/game vs ~0.38) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: back <strong>D'Andre Swift</strong>'s rushing volume in favored/positive scripts; their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing RB1s</strong> smash on the ground and at the goal line.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Caleb Williams","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":8,"props":{"Comp":19.72,"Att":32.93,"Pass Yds":220.64,"Pass TD":1.36,"INT":0.44,"Rush Yds":21.48}}],"RB":[{"name":"D'Andre Swift","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":32,"props":{"Rush Att":11.91,"Rush Yds":52.82,"Tgt":2.46,"Rec":1.89,"Rec Yds":14.51}},{"name":"Kyle Monangai","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":23,"props":{"Rush Att":7.55,"Rush Yds":34.06,"Tgt":2.75,"Rec":1.93,"Rec Yds":15.98}},{"name":"Roschon Johnson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":14,"props":{"Rush Att":1.67,"Rush Yds":6.39,"Tgt":1.83,"Rec":1.27,"Rec Yds":8.15}},{"name":"Salvon Ahmed","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":15,"props":{"Rush Att":2.42,"Rush Yds":7.97,"Tgt":2.89,"Rec":1.81,"Rec Yds":13.83}}],"WR":[{"name":"Rome Odunze","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":22,"props":{"Tgt":5.88,"Rec":3.18,"Rec Yds":45.57,"Rec TD":0.25}},{"name":"Luther Burden III","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":16,"props":{"Tgt":4.68,"Rec":3.25,"Rec Yds":43.1,"Rec TD":0.17}},{"name":"Kalif Raymond","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":9,"props":{"Tgt":2.37,"Rec":1.47,"Rec Yds":18.3,"Rec TD":0.1}},{"name":"Zavion Thomas","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Tgt":2.43,"Rec":1.35,"Rec Yds":16.72,"Rec TD":0.11}},{"name":"Jahdae Walker","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":17,"props":{"Tgt":3.12,"Rec":1.94,"Rec Yds":25.41,"Rec TD":0.18}}],"TE":[{"name":"Colston Loveland","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":30,"props":{"Tgt":7.44,"Rec":5.08,"Rec Yds":62.37,"Rec TD":0.37}},{"name":"Cole Kmet","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":15,"props":{"Tgt":3.18,"Rec":2.04,"Rec Yds":20.73,"Rec TD":0.17}},{"name":"Sam Roush","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":11,"props":{"Tgt":2.41,"Rec":1.46,"Rec Yds":14.39,"Rec TD":0.12}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"@","opp":"CAR","opp_col":"#3AC7F0","gid":"2026_01_CHI_CAR","spread":"\u22122.5","proj":"24\u201321","win":true},{"week":2,"ha":"vs"